WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Chen Lao

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,440
There are a lot of weird things in this neighborhood

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,440
What if there was a 3S level weirdo as a tour guide?

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,040
Maybe it can be really safer

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,040
I don’t know what price you want

6
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,240
I don’t charge much. Give me three nos.

7
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,440
Two million is enough. That's it.

8
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,640
You won't be reporting high, right?

9
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,240
If I lose this business

10
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,240
My rent won't go down next month.

11
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,200
It's so cheap

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,040
Then please be our tour guide, don't worry.

13
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,440
I promise I won't let you get any harm done

14
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,800
I'll pay this guy back

15
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,840
Don't talk about martial ethics

16
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,040
This money is so easy to earn

17
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,040
How could he be allowed to have it all to himself?

18
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:37,230
boss boss

19
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,150
look at me

20
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:40,750
I only need 1.8 million to be a tour guide

21
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:43,150
Boss, I only want 1.7 million.

22
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:45,980
These weird feelings

23
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,380
How do you feel that you have the same virtue as this senior?
